  "term": "voluntary turnover",
  "definition": "Voluntary turnover is staff turnover that happens by employees’ own choice. In healthcare settings, it is described as a serious problem because it can worsen staffing shortages, affect workers’ well-being, and contribute to poorer patient care and higher costs.",
